#. 犯人は死体にビニールシートを
#. 被せる事で…
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "By covering the body with the tarp..."
msgstr ""

#. 死体が濡れないようにしたのよ。
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...the killer prevented it from getting wet."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、ビニールシートが
#. <CLT 9>片面だけ汚れてた<CLT>のは…
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"So the reason the tarp\n"
"was <CLT 9>only dirty on one side<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. その面がスプリンクラーを
#. 浴びたせいか！
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...is because the sprinkler got that side wet!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、そのビニールシートの裏面は…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But the underside of the tarp..."
msgstr ""

#. 少しも汚れてなかったよね？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was totally spotless, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そっちは、スプリンクラーを
#. <CLT 9>浴びてねーから<CLT>な！
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It's cuz that side\n"
"<CLT 9>was protected from the water<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 死体に面してただけだから…
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Since it was facing down toward the body..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>キレイなまま<CLT>で当然だべ！
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...of course it <CLT 9>didn't get dirty<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>やっぱり苗木が犯人？<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Did Makoto really do it?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>そうに決まってるわ…！<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>That's gotta be it...!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>一理あるな…<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>She has a point...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>ええ、そうよ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>That's right...<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Đúng vậy...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 26>何よ…言い訳？<CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Is there any explanation?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>それがどうかしたの…？<CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>If that's true, so what?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>それはそうだろう…<CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>That makes sense...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>あ…そっか！<CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Ah, that's right!<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>葉隠の言う通りだよ…多分！<CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hiro might actually be right!<CLT>"
msgstr ""
